<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Duet Blog</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site-shell">
    <nav class="top-nav">
      <a class="brand" href="/">DUET<small>visual notes</small></a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a data-nav-link href="/">首页</a>
        <a data-nav-link href="/pages/blog.html">博客</a>
        <div class="tools-nav-group">
          <a data-nav-link href="/pages/tools.html">工具</a>
          <div class="tools-nav-menu" data-tools-menu></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <aside class="side-nav" aria-label="侧边导航">
      <a data-nav-link href="/">首页</a>
      <a data-nav-link href="/pages/blog.html">博客</a>
      <a data-nav-link href="/pages/tools.html">工具</a>
    </aside>

    <main class="showcase-home">
      <section class="showcase-hero">
        <div class="hero-copy editorial-card soft-white">
          <span class="kicker">Display Landing</span>
          <p class="eyebrow">DUET STUDIO NOTEBOOK</p>
          <h1>把博客做成一块会呼吸的展示画布</h1>
          <p class="hero-intro">
            用轻快的 pastel 色、插画式几何块面和杂志感排版，把博客、工具和手账内容排成一张完整首页。
          </p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/pages/blog.html">Browse Journal</a>
            <a class="btn" href="/pages/tools.html">Open Toolbox</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="poster-board editorial-card peach-wave">
          <div class="poster-chip">Pastel / Light / Editorial</div>
          <div class="poster-grid">
            <div class="poster-statement">
              <span>Quiet tools,</span>
              <span>colorful thoughts,</span>
              <span>rainy routines.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="poster-orbit">
              <div class="orbit-circle orbit-one"></div>
              <div class="orbit-circle orbit-two"></div>
              <div class="orbit-card orbit-note">NOTES</div>
              <div class="orbit-card orbit-tool">TOOLS</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-card editorial-card mint-layers">
          <p class="stack-label">手账 / Blog / Archive</p>
          <div class="smear-stack" aria-label="手绘小动物展示">
            <div class="smear-strip smear-strip-top">
              <img src="/assets/illustrations/pic.jpg" alt="手绘小猫" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-note editorial-card lilac-note">
          <p class="memo-title">TODAY</p>
          <div class="showcase-date-display" id="showcase-date">--</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="glance-viewport">
        <div class="glance-band" data-duplicate-track>
          <article class="glance-card">
            <strong>Visual blog</strong>
            <span>模块化、柔和色、会流动的内容。</span>
          </article>
          <article class="glance-card">
            <strong>Tool drop-down</strong>
            <span>悬浮展开菜单，点击直接跳转。</span>
          </article>
          <article class="glance-card">
            <strong>Local assets</strong>
            <span>Markdown 可直接引用项目内图片。</span>
          </article>
          <article class="glance-card">
            <strong>Journal mood</strong>
            <span>手账气质和轻编辑设计结合。</span>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="showcase-grid">
        <article class="editorial-card coral-panel">
          <p class="panel-kicker">Daily Ritual</p>
          <h2>早晨网格、雨天片段、桌面草图，都能被整理成同一个视觉系统。</h2>
        </article>
        <article class="editorial-card cream-panel">
          <p class="panel-kicker">Curation</p>
          <ul class="panel-list">
            <li>首页负责展示氛围</li>
            <li>博客页负责浏览与跳转</li>
            <li>工具页负责访问所有 HTML 工具</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="editorial-card blue-panel">
          <p class="panel-kicker">Small Quote</p>
          <blockquote>Build a quiet place for loud ideas.</blockquote>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="calendar-section editorial-card soft-white">
        <div class="calendar-head">
          <div>
            <p class="panel-kicker">Publishing Calendar</p>
            <h2>当月发布日程</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="calendar-controls">
            <button type="button" class="calendar-nav-btn" id="calendar-prev-month">上月</button>
            <select id="calendar-year-select" class="calendar-select"></select>
            <select id="calendar-month-select" class="calendar-select"></select>
            <button type="button" class="calendar-nav-btn" id="calendar-next-month">下月</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="calendar-layout">
          <div class="calendar-board" id="calendar-board"></div>
        </div>
        <div id="calendar-post-tooltip" class="calendar-post-tooltip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script src="../scripts/main.ts"></script>
  <script src="../scripts/home.ts"></script>
</body>
</html>
